om2 diag bce
note bce fixture written: the body assigns the counter (i = add i 2), so i < K no longer holds at the get
note and its check is kept: i runs 2, 5, ..., 62, then 65 and get a 65 traps 3 (exit 103). A compiler that
note ignores the body scan reads b[1] and does not trap.
global a ulong 64
global b ulong 64
fn main to int
for i ulong 64
put a i i
put b i 200
end
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 64
i = add i 2
s = add s get a i
end
ret int rem s 256
end
